{"seq":3,"slug":"overall-appraisal","title":"综合评价","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marcus-aurelius/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-philosopher-king","title":"哲学家皇帝","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marcus-aurelius/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/the-philosopher-king","wordCount":1532,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-balanced-assessment","title":"全面的评判","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marcus-aurelius/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/a-balanced-assessment","wordCount":1537,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"综合评价\">综合评价</h1><p>本章在客观审视争议的基础上，对马可·奥勒留做出全面的综合评价。一方面，充分肯定他作为&quot;哲学家皇帝&quot;的崇高品格与深邃智慧；另一方面，也客观地正视围绕其统治的争议。两篇文档，分别呈现哲学家皇帝，以及一个全面而辩证的评判。</p>\n"}